client_msg_id":"d84465e1-a5b2-4e09-a9d0-5ff49d7b38d6","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"executableのコストとか忘れがち","ts":"1618199517.439900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G3TB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8fc0a63f-1810-4dc5-8a36-6cedbf66fb12","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"はい","ts":"1618199502.439800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"flznr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31642d4b-4a42-4cc2-8c9b-9100c1c3d2c9","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"それでなくても `executable()` は遅い。なおWindowsだともっと遅い。","ts":"1618198534.439700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jn3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a39ffec-bf5c-4cfc-94ae-1540bdcd2788","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"Vim+Macで遅くなる代表はMac判定に使う `executable()` が遅い件です。","ts":"1618198411.439100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":2,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX","U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4nAU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0fbf82fe-0625-4c18-85db-2e1e42ea9294","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"何度か貼った気がするけどこういう関数をシェル側に仕込んでおくと便利です\n```function vim-startuptime-detail() {\n  local time_file\n  time_file=$(mktemp --suffix \"_vim_startuptime.txt\")\n  echo \"output: $time_file\"\n  time nvim --startuptime $time_file -c q\n  tail -n 1 $time_file | cut -d \" \" -f1 | tr -d \"\\n\" \u0026amp;\u0026amp; echo \" [ms]\\n\"\n  cat $time_file | sort -n -k 2 | tail -n 20\n}```","ts":"1618197644.438000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":3,"users":["UL6CFN8NR","UDDCM376D","U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CczIy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e367523a-dc7a-4d02-910b-b100aa057113","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"とりあえず、プロファイルを掛けてみたらどうですかね","ts":"1618197567.436900","edited":{"user":"U06ECBRTJ","ts":"1618197575.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9ue8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"44842a29-8166-4b15-9da3-9a62f2d7ce67","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"遅延読み込みとかを設定した状態でneovim起動したら\nMac: 約100msec\nLinux:約30msec\nになった。起動時間に差が出るのはなんでなんだろ？\nもともとLinux向けに作られていて、他のOS上で動作する場合にOSに合わせた追加の処理が走ったりするから？","ts":"1618197182.436500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u2LK2"}]}]
